<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="2002970862"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1893555827"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="星になる (feat. 倚水)"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Islet / 倚水"/><amll:meta key="album" value="星になる (feat. 倚水)"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:53.776"><div begin="00:15.258" end="03:53.776"><p begin="00:15.258" end="00:21.904" itunes:key="L1">ふと見上げたあの夜空が<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">蓦然抬头仰望天空</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu to mi a ge ta a no yo zo ra ga</span></p><p begin="00:21.905" end="00:29.565" itunes:key="L2">いつもより近く感じた気がしたんだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">发觉天空似乎比往常</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i tsu mo yo ri</span></p><p begin="00:29.566" end="00:35.874" itunes:key="L3">鬱いだ日々にさよならを告げるように<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为了与忧郁苦闷的日子</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu sa i da hi bi ni</span></p><p begin="00:35.875" end="00:42.286" itunes:key="L4">傷付いた翼を広げた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">伸展受伤的羽翼</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki zu tsu i ta tsu ba sa wo hi ro ge ta</span></p><p begin="00:42.287" end="00:46.061" itunes:key="L5">駆け出して 飛び立って<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">振翅起飞 驰骋天际</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka ke da shi te to bi ta 't te</span></p><p begin="00:46.062" end="00:49.434" itunes:key="L6">夜空を游ぐ光のように<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">宛如夜空中游走的星光</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yo zo ra wo o yo gu hi ka ri no yo u ni</span></p><p begin="00:49.435" end="00:53.167" itunes:key="L7">羽ばたいて 高鳴って<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">展翅高飞 心潮澎湃</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha ba ta i te ta ka na 't te</span></p><p begin="00:53.168" end="00:57.584" itunes:key="L8">この鼓動響かせたら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让这激烈心跳 响彻天地</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko no ko do u hi bi ka se ta ra</span></p><p begin="00:57.585" end="01:04.303" itunes:key="L9">一番光る星が僕の道しるべだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那颗最亮的星 是为我指引方向的路标</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i chi ba n hi ka ru ho shi ga bo ku no mi chi shi ru be da</span></p><p begin="01:04.304" end="01:11.828" itunes:key="L10">彼方まで連れ去って<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">引领着我 前往遥远的天际彼方</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka na ta ma de tsu re sa 't te</span></p><p begin="01:11.829" end="01:18.961" itunes:key="L11">満天の空に埋もれそうな小さな星が瞬く<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">几乎被漫天虚空彻底湮没</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma n te n no so ra ni u mo re so u na</span></p><p begin="01:18.962" end="01:26.121" itunes:key="L12">懸命なその姿になれたならって思うんだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那竭尽全力散发光芒的模样</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ke n me i na so no su ga ta ni</span></p><p begin="01:26.122" end="01:27.591" itunes:key="L13">打ちのめされた現状に<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">被残酷现状击垮</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u chi no me sa re ta ge n jo u ni</span></p><p begin="01:27.592" end="01:29.496" itunes:key="L14">生きる意味も理由も無くなって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">失去了活下去的意义与动力</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ki ru i mi mo ri yu u mo na ku na 't te</span></p><p begin="01:29.497" end="01:32.735" itunes:key="L15">でも確かにこの胸は脈打っている<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可这颗心仍在坚定跳动</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">de mo ta shi ka ni ko no mu ne ha mya ku u 't te i ru</span></p><p begin="01:32.736" end="01:39.156" itunes:key="L16">消えかかっていた心に火を灯した<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在这即将消失的心中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki e ka ka 't te i ta ko ko ro ni</span></p><p begin="01:39.157" end="01:46.326" itunes:key="L17">輝いて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">闪耀光芒</span></p><p begin="01:46.327" end="01:54.319" itunes:key="L18">彩って ほら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">来吧 涂抹绚烂色彩</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ro do 't te ho ra</span></p><p begin="01:54.320" end="01:57.897" itunes:key="L19">痛みや苦しみだって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无论伤痛困苦</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ta mi ya ku ru shi mi da 't te</span></p><p begin="01:57.898" end="02:01.439" itunes:key="L20">力に変えるような<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">皆能化作力量</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">chi ka ra ni ka e ru yo u na</span></p><p begin="02:01.440" end="02:08.895" itunes:key="L21">この翼なら翔べるから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">定能以这双羽翼 展翅飞翔</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko no tsu ba sa na ra to be ru ka ra</span></p><p begin="02:08.896" end="02:19.250" itunes:key="L22">♪</p><p begin="02:19.251" end="02:22.733" itunes:key="L23">朝になって 光が差して<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">清晨来临 阳光洒落</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a sa ni na 't te hi ka ri ga sa shi te</span></p><p begin="02:22.734" end="02:26.331" itunes:key="L24">また世界に期待をして<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">再次对世界满怀期待</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma ta se ka i ni ki ta i wo shi te</span></p><p begin="02:26.332" end="02:29.804" itunes:key="L25">夜になって 孤独を知って<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">夜幕降临 知晓孤独</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yo ru ni na 't te ko do ku wo shi 't te</span></p><p begin="02:29.805" end="02:33.460" itunes:key="L26">意味のない繰り返しだった<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">身陷如此毫无意义的循环</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i mi no na i ku ri ka e shi da 't ta</span></p><p begin="02:33.461" end="02:36.918" itunes:key="L27">だけどやっと見つけたんだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但我终于找到了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da ke do ya 't to mi tsu ke ta n da</span></p><p begin="02:36.919" end="02:40.335" itunes:key="L28">この命輝く場所<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的生命得以璀璨绽放之处</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko no i no chi ka ga ya ku ba sho</span></p><p begin="02:40.336" end="02:43.837" itunes:key="L29">どこまでもゆこう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">去往千里之外</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do ko ma de mo yu ko u</span></p><p begin="02:43.838" end="02:46.796" itunes:key="L30">空の果てまで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">前往天际尽头</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so ra no ha te ma de</span></p><p begin="02:46.797" end="02:50.515" itunes:key="L31">駆け出して 飛び立って<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">振翅起飞 驰骋天际</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka ke da shi te to bi ta 't te</span></p><p begin="02:50.516" end="02:53.868" itunes:key="L32">夜空を游ぐ光のように<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">宛如夜空中游走的星光</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yo zo ra wo o yo gu hi ka ri no yo u ni</span></p><p begin="02:53.869" end="02:57.614" itunes:key="L33">羽ばたいて 高鳴って<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">展翅高飞 心潮澎湃</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha ba ta i te ta ka na 't te</span></p><p begin="02:57.615" end="03:02.050" itunes:key="L34">この身が燃え尽きたって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">哪怕燃尽此身</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko no mi ga mo e tsu ki ta 't te</span></p><p begin="03:02.051" end="03:08.726" itunes:key="L35">いつかこの軌跡が誰かを照らせたなら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">留下的轨迹终有一日</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i tsu ka ko no ki se ki ga</span></p><p begin="03:08.727" end="03:18.766" itunes:key="L36">今僕は星になる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">此刻 我便化作繁星</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ma bo ku ha ho shi ni na ru</span></p><p begin="03:18.767" end="03:27.126" itunes:key="L37">夜をも越えてゆけ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">勇敢跨越长夜</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yo ru wo mo ko e te yu ke</span></p><p begin="03:27.127" end="03:53.776" itunes:key="L38">♪</p></div></body></tt>